{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07304","headline":"送邵州判官往南 · 刘长卿","name":"送邵州判官往南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看君发原隰，驷牡志皇皇。\n始罢沧江令，还随粉署郎。\n海沂军未息，河兖岁仍荒。\n征税人全少，榛芜虏近亡。\n新知行宋远，相望隔淮长。\n早晚裁书寄，银钩伫八行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}